  },
  "observation": "Three separate right-directed horizontal number lines, vertically stacked and aligned at the same 2 and 3 endpoints. All show sqrt(5) at the same coordinate between 2 and 3. Source subfigure letters are Cyrillic a/be/ve, mapped to the current edition a/b/c. No answer-choice preference or decimal expansion of sqrt(5) is printed.",
  "subfigures": [
    {
      "id": "a",
      "sourceLetter": "а",
      "modernLetter": "a",
      "domain": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "intervalCount": 1,
      "tickCount": 2,
      "step": "1",
      "labels": [
        "2",
        "3"
      ],
      "rootLabel": "√5",
      "observation": "Only endpoint ticks 2 and 3 plus the sqrt(5) mark; numeric labels below and root label above."
    },
    {
      "id": "b",
      "sourceLetter": "б",
      "modernLetter": "b",
      "domain": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "intervalCount": 10,
      "tickCount": 11,
      "step": "0.1",
      "labels": [
        "2",
        "2.1",
        "2.2",
        "2.3",
        "2.4",
        "2.5",
        "2.6",
        "2.7",
        "2.8",
        "2.9",
        "3"
      ],
      "rootLabel": "√5",
      "observation": "All eleven tenths ticks and labels, 2 through 3 inclusive; sqrt(5) lies between 2.2 and 2.3. Numeric labels below and root label above."
    },
    {
      "id": "c",
      "sourceLetter": "в",
      "modernLetter": "c",
      "domain": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "intervalCount": 100,
      "tickCount": 101,
      "step": "0.01",
      "majorTickCount": 11,
      "minorTickCount": 90,
      "labels": [
        "2",
        "2.2",
        "2.3",
        "3",
        "2.23",
        "2.24"
      ],
      "rootLabel": "√5",
      "observation": "The whole 2-to-3 interval is ruled in hundredths, not merely 2.2-to-2.3. Longer marks at tenths. The source prints 2, 2.2, 2.3, 3 and callout labels 2.23 and 2.24 below. sqrt(5) is between the adjacent 2.23 and 2.24 ticks. The callouts distinguish the nearby hundredth positions; there are no labels at other hundredths."
    }
  ],
  "additions": [
    "Cyrillic subfigure labels become a/b/c, matching current lesson prose.",
    "All three lines retain the same affine x scale and endpoint alignment.",
    "Subfigure c endpoint/tenths labels are placed above the line; hundredth callouts stay below with exact leader anchors. This is label-layout regularization, not new source data.",
    "Tiny point objects locate ticks exactly; their visible glyphs are negligible beside the original vertical tick structure.",
    "Fixed 640 px horizontal-scroll media prevents unreadable hundredth ticks and labels at narrow viewport widths."
  ],
